  "body": "If you're thinking about your next move but aren't quite ready to compromise on space, quality or comfort, this exceptional single-level Sicato home deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nBeautifully designed and built by one of the area's most respected builders, this is a home that offers the best of both worlds - generous proportions, quality finishes and the freedom of easy, single-level living, all in an established and peaceful Millwater neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, there's a sense of space and understated quality. The separate lounge, complete with built-in bookshelves and cabinetry, provides a quiet retreat, while the spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and family living area is the natural heart of the home. A large stone island bench, well-appointed pantry and thoughtful detailing make this a space that's equally suited to everyday living or entertaining friends and family.\r\n\r\nTwo sets of ranch sliders connect the living areas to a partially covered deck and beautifully established, fully fenced garden. With mature planting, productive fruit trees and plenty of privacy, the hard work has already been done. Simply sit back, relax and enjoy it.\r\n\r\nOne of the real advantages here is the flexibility. Four generous double bedrooms mean there's plenty of room for visiting family and friends, while the dedicated study offers the perfect space for working from home or pursuing hobbies and crafts.\r\n\r\nThe substantial master suite opens directly to the garden, and both bathrooms feature beautifully tiled showers. Everything is conveniently arranged on one level - no stairs to contend with, and no need to sacrifice the space you've become accustomed to.\r\n\r\nImmaculately presented throughout, the home also offers excellent storage, a carpeted double garage and generous off-street parking. Even the integrated sound system adds another dimension to entertaining or simply enjoying time at home.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. Set in a quiet, established part of Millwater, you're within easy reach of local shops, cafés, medical services, beaches and motorway connections. It's a neighbourhood where the gardens have grown, the streets have settled and everything you need is close at hand.\r\n\r\nIf you've worked hard to get where you are, your next home should be something special.\r\n\r\nWhether you're moving on from a larger family home, relocating to be closer to family or simply looking for quality single-level living, 114 Harris Drive offers an opportunity to make your next chapter a very comfortable one.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have their sights firmly set on their next move. Come and experience the quality, space and lifestyle for yourself - we think you'll be impressed.",
